      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "SettW",
        "name": "蓄意轰拳",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "瑟提会被动地将他受到的伤害储存为豪意。在施放时，瑟提会释放所有已储存的豪意来提供一层护盾并且重击一个区域，在区域中心造成真实伤害并在区域边缘造成物理伤害。",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">被动：</span>瑟提将受到的100%伤害储存为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">豪意</span>，储量上限为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">([[si:scalehealth]]50% 生命值)</span>。<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">豪意</span>在停止受到伤害的4秒后会快速衰减。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">主动：</span>瑟提将所有<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">豪意</span>迸发出来，获得<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">100%迸发豪意值的护盾值</span>，护盾值会在3秒里持续衰减。瑟提随后会轰出一记重拳，对中央的所有敌人造成<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">80/100/120/140/160外加(25% + ([[si:scalead]]0.25% 额外攻击力))迸发豪意值的真实伤害</span>(最大伤害为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">([[si:scalehealth]]50% 生命值) × (25% + [[si:scalead]]0.25% 额外攻击力)</span>)。不在中央的敌人会受到<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">物理伤害</span>作为替代。",
        "iconFile": "SettW.png",
